cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to Open Clinic SRA, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Open Clinic SRA: A free, open-source HIPAA Security Risk Assessment for small and rural medical practices"
abstract: >-
  Open Clinic SRA is a browser-based HIPAA Security Risk Assessment tool for
  small and rural medical practices. It presents plain-language questions
  derived from the HIPAA Security Rule (45 CFR Part 164, Subpart C), scores
  risk using a likelihood-times-impact method consistent with NIST SP 800-30,
  produces a prioritized remediation plan and a signed report, and covers AI
  tools that access electronic protected health information. All answers stay
  in the user's browser.
authors:
